        {
          "sentence": 13,
          "component": "Test Driver",
          "source": "partial_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "TestNG is used for Java testing (all levels) and Jest for JavaScript unit-testing."
        },
        {
          "sentence": 14,
          "component": "Test Driver",
          "source": "partial_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "HttpUnit is used to set up a simulated web server in servlet-level tests, where an actual web server is not required."
        },
        {
          "sentence": 16,
          "component": "Test Driver",
          "source": "partial_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "Its primary function is for E2E tests."
        },
        {
          "sentence": 17,
          "component": "Test Driver",
          "source": "partial_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "Selenium Java is used to automate E2E testing with actual Web browsers."
        },
        {
          "sentence": 56,
          "component": "Test Driver",
          "source": "partial_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "Special keys (csrf key and backdoor key) can be used to bypass each of the checks, typically for testing purpose."
        },
        {
          "sentence": 64,
          "component": "Test Driver",
          "source": "partial_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "This is particularly useful in testing the actions associated with those requests."
        },
        {
          "sentence": 125,
          "component": "Storage",
          "source": "full_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "Classes in the storage.entity package are not visible outside this component to hide information specific to data persis"
        },
        {
          "sentence": 131,
          "component": "Storage",
          "source": "full_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "storage.api provides the API of the component to be accessed by the logic component."
        },
        {
          "sentence": 140,
          "component": "Test Driver",
          "source": "partial_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "However, it is expected to avoid test failures caused by eventual consistency in dev server and reduce such problems in "
        },
        {
          "sentence": 160,
          "component": "Common",
          "source": "full_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "common.datatransfer package contains lightweight data transfer object classes for transferring data among components."
        },
        {
          "sentence": 170,
          "component": "Test Driver",
          "source": "partial_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "test.driver contains infrastructure and helpers needed for running the tests."
        },
        {
          "sentence": 171,
          "component": "Test Driver",
          "source": "partial_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
          "text": "test.cases contains test cases."
        },
        {
          "sentence": 174,
          "component": "Test Driver",
          "source": "partial_name",
          "confidence": 1.0,
